N:Note the delightful use of the now archaic subjunctive in the title.
N:
N:Variants of the tune were popular in the US during its Civil War.
N: -- Think melody on fife, with drum accompaniment.
N:
N:NB1) Note placement uncertain. Either e or d, but probably e in parallel to measure B.3.
N:NB2) this B is clearly marked as accidental C natural, poss to correct from wrong C sharp!
