T:Breeches Loose. Roose.0013
B:J.Roose MS, Manchester, 1850
Z:Village Music Project 2019 Eric Conrad
M:6/8
Q:3/8=120
L:1/8
N:From Fiddlers' Companion:
N:First published in John Johnson's Choice Collection of 200 Favourite Country
N:Dances, v5 (1748). It apparently became associated with
N:the next tune, 'Petticoat Loose', when the two were published on the same
N:page in Thompson's Compleat Collection of 200 Favourite Country Dances, v1 (1757).
N: -- see Fiddlers' Companion for more information.
