T:Old Roger De Coverley. Roose.0020
B:J.Roose MS, Manchester, 1850
Z:Village Music Project 2019 Eric Conrad
M:9/8
Q:3/8=120
L:1/8
N:Each wedge generates one warning in Abc2midi. These warnings can be ignored.
N:
N:NB1) In the MS (and here!), the pickup (correctly!) comes before the repeat.
N:NB2) Natural assumed here analogous to measure 1 of C part.
N:  (This natural is not in the MS.  Note that Nineteenth century conventions for
N:  duration of accidentals differ from today's conventions, so this is a difference
N:  of convention and not an error.)
W:Key sig should probably be Dmaj
K:A
"_NB1"A, |: (B,/C/D)!wedge!D D2B AFD | C2E EFD CB,A, | \\
(B,/C/D)!wedge!D D2B ABc | d2F D>ED D2A, :|
