N:From Wikipedia: Saxe-Coburg and Gotha (German: Sachsen-Coburg und Gotha), or Saxe-Coburg-Gotha,
N:was an Ernestine, Thuringian duchy ruled by a branch of the House of Wettin, consisting of
N:territories in the present-day states of Thuringia and Bavaria in Germany. It lasted from
N:1826 to 1918 (i.e. until the end of World War I).
N:NB2) Slur within slur, as in MS.  [These generate harmless warnings in abc2midi.]
N:NB3) No additional slurring. (Contrast with measure A1.)
